TrackSound downloads and bundles third-party data that has its own terms; see the
"Data and attribution" section of README.md. Notably, ADS-B flight history from adsb.lol is
licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL 1.0). The standalone apps include an ffmpeg
build (via imageio-ffmpeg), which is licensed under the GPL/LGPL.
